              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 16:59",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yamar’ aramugarariza, atuma intumwa ziwe muri Egiputa, gusaba ngo bamuhe amafarasi n’ingabo nyinshi. Mbeg’ ūkora ibisa birtyo azororanirwa, canke se arokoke? Yokwica isezerano kand’ akarokoka? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndahiye ukubaho kwanje, ni k’Umwami Uhoraho agize: ku murwa nyene w’umwami yamwimitse, uwo yarahiye indahiro, akayihindura ubusa, akica n’isezerano ryiwe, aho ni ho nyene azogwa, ari hafi yiwe i Babuloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.37.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 37:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Farawo, n’ingabo ziwe zihambaye n’ibitero vyinshi, nta co azomumarira mur’ iyo ntambara, igihe bazorunda ibigunguzi vyo kwūririrako, bakubaka ibihome, kugira ngo bageseze abantu benshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kukw iyo ndahiro yarahiye yayihinduje ubusa kwica isezerano; mbere yari yaramanitse ukuboko arahira, kandi none yakoze ivyo vyose: eka ntazorokoka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko rero, uku ni k’Umwami Uhoraho agize, ati Ndahiye ukubaho kwanje: indahiro yanje yahinduye ubusa, n’isezerano ryanje yishe, nzobimusubiza ku mutwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
